WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.868 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening, I'm Seth Meyers
and this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.868 --> 00:00:03.503 align:start size:94% position:6%
how is everybody doing tonight
Alright! Good to hear.

00:00:03.503 --> 00:00:06.539 size:84% position:42%
Even on a Monday? Okay.
Let's get to the news.

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
Following the news
that Kentucky Derby winner

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:12.512 size:88% position:44%
Medina Spirit had failed
a post-race drug test,

00:00:12.512 --> 00:00:14.781 size:81% position:41%
former President Trump
released a statement

00:00:14.781 --> 00:00:17.350 align:start size:94% position:6%
on his website yesterday,
that said,

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:19.085 align:start size:94% position:6%
"So, now, even our
Kentucky Derby winner,

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:23.056
Medina Spirit is a junkie,
which brings us to a segment

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:25.859 align:start size:94% position:6%
called "Dammit,
That's Really Funny."

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:29.262 size:78% position:39% line:92%
[ Theme music plays ]

00:00:29.262 --> 00:00:32.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
Okay, obviously,
I dislike this man.

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
But it is possible
to dislike someone

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:38.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
and think calling a horse
a junkie is very, very funny

00:00:38.371 --> 00:00:42.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
This was an official statement
from the former president,

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:44.477 line:92%
calling a horse a junkie.

00:00:44.477 --> 00:00:47.547
As if it bought the drugs itself
in some back alley.

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:50.116 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like it only got caught
'cause the horse's parents

00:00:50.116 --> 00:00:52.685 align:start size:94% position:6%
found it in a shoebox
under its bed, its stable?

00:00:52.685 --> 00:00:57.590 align:start size:94% position:6%
Again, I cannot stress enough,
I do not like this man.

00:00:57.590 --> 00:01:00.860 line:92%
But, dammit, it's really funny

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:04.731 size:84% position:42%
This has been "Damn It,
That's Really Funny."

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:07.067 align:start size:94% position:6%
Maryland Governor Larry Hoga
criticized

00:01:07.067 --> 00:01:09.135
his fellow Republicans
in an interview yesterday

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.104
for continuing to support
former President Trump,

00:01:11.104 --> 00:01:14.874
and said, "It just bothers m
that you have to swear fealt

00:01:14.874 --> 00:01:17.844 align:start size:94% position:6%
to the dear leader, or you get
kicked out of the party."

00:01:17.844 --> 00:01:19.446 size:84% position:42% line:92%
If only there was a way

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:22.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
that we could have
seen all of this coming.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:25.018 align:start size:94% position:6%
Republican Congressman Ada
Kinzinger

00:01:25.018 --> 00:01:28.154 align:start size:94% position:6%
yesterday criticized the GOP
for the ongoing debate

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:30.457 align:start size:94% position:6%
whether to remove
Conference Chair Liz Cheney,

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:33.726 align:start size:94% position:6%
and said the party is
"basically the Titanic."

00:01:33.726 --> 00:01:34.494 size:78% position:39% line:92%
I don't know, though.

00:01:34.494 --> 00:01:38.631
When the "Titanic" went down
people tried to get off it

00:01:38.631 --> 00:01:40.100 line:92%
"Women and children first,

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then we party,
right, gentlemen?"

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:46.239
Florida Governor Ron DeSanti
signed new voting restrictions

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:48.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
into law last week
at the airport Hilton

00:01:48.608 --> 00:01:49.476 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in West Palm Beach,

00:01:49.476 --> 00:01:52.178
and only allowed Fox News
to broadcast the event.

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
Also, the airport Hilton
in West Palm Beach

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:56.983 align:start size:94% position:6%
is now Florida's
only polling place.

00:01:56.983 --> 00:02:00.587
According to reports, Microsof
co-founder Bill Gates' wife,

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:02.288 align:start size:94% position:6%
Melinda, may have filed
for divorce

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.791 align:start size:94% position:6%
over concerns about her
husband's previous dealing

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.259 align:start size:94% position:6%
with sex trafficker Jeffre
Epstein.

00:02:06.259 --> 00:02:11.297
Wow, even Bill Gates has trouble
clearing his history.

00:02:11.297 --> 00:02:12.665 size:81% position:41% line:92%
According to Politico,

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:15.502 align:start size:94% position:6%
87-year-old Iowa Senator
Chuck Grassley

00:02:15.502 --> 00:02:16.903 line:92%
gets up at 4:00 a.m. every day

00:02:16.903 --> 00:02:21.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
as well as 5:15, 6:00 a.m.
6:45, and 7:10.

00:02:21.441 --> 00:02:22.208 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.612
That's right, 87-year-old
Iowa Senator Chuck Grassle

00:02:25.612 --> 00:02:27.013 line:92%
gets up at 4:00 a.m. every day

00:02:27.013 --> 00:02:29.582 align:start size:94% position:6%
and often goes for
a two-mile run

00:02:29.582 --> 00:02:30.350 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
