00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:58.811 align:start size:94% position:6%
because da Vinci was originall
trying to draw a dog.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:03.616 align:start size:94% position:6%
"It's no good.
"No, it's very good."

00:03:03.616 --> 00:03:05.451 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:08.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
"It's a bear?"
"It's a dog!"

00:03:08.354 --> 00:03:09.322 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:09.322 --> 00:03:13.092
Finally, yesterday was singe
Billy Joel's 72nd birthday

00:03:13.092 --> 00:03:17.230 size:81% position:41%
And this time, he did
almost start the fire.

00:03:17.230 --> 00:03:18.798 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:22.402 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Oh, wait."
